      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-chalk pt-14 max-md:pt-10\" data-v-b9b01642><section id=\"section-agent-mesh-hero\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative items-center section-shell--nav-clearance pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-b9b01642 data-v-1c6297c3><h1 class=\"product-hero__title text-center text-7xl font-normal text-slatecolor max-md:text-5xl\" data-v-b9b01642><span class=\"product-hero__title-line block max-md:inline\" data-v-b9b01642>The connected agent</span><span class=\"product-hero__title-line block max-md:inline\" data-v-b9b01642>framework you own</span></h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-prose text-center text-lg leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-b9b01642>Agent Mesh is a framework for connected agents, deployed by Fyntix's AI engineers. Your knowledge, your workflows, your IP to keep.</p><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6\" data-v-b9b01642><a href=\"#section-agent-mesh-layers\" class=\"pointer-events-auto\" data-v-b9b01642><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full tracking-tight cursor-pointer transition-all duration-150 ease-out text-center outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal border border-transparent text-chalk bg-slate-dark shadow-button hover:bg-portal-surface hover:text-chalk font-medium text-sm leading-normal py-3.5 px-7\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">See what's included</span></button></a></div><div class=\"product-hero__frame mt-16 max-md:mt-10\" data-v-b9b01642><div class=\"product-hero__crop\" data-v-b9b01642><div class=\"content-image\" data-v-b9b01642><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRoQAAABXRUJQVlA4WAoAAAAQAAAAHwAAEwAAQUxQSCYAAAABJ9D/iAgYimzja/C/BkYDEfTP5R9dI/o/AR04axN3jgwUXFoPB1ZQOCA4AAAA8AIAnQEqIAAUAD85lsFaPqqnKqgIA9AnCWcAAEJ45AAA/u2nMJaRiooJWg8p+8v+lvMoIASMCAA=);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-slack-q2-sales.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-slack-q2-sales.gen-1280w.avif 1280w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-slack-q2-sales.gen.avif 1876w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 59rem\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-slack-q2-sales.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-slack-q2-sales.gen-1280w.webp 1280w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-slack-q2-sales.gen.webp 1876w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 59rem\"><img src=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-slack-q2-sales.gen.webp\" alt=\"Agent Mesh answering a Q2 sales question in Slack with a revenue table and an anomaly flag\" class=\"product-hero__screen block h-auto w-full content-image__main\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div><span class=\"product-hero__scrim\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b9b01642></span></div></section></div>"
