      "html": "<div class=\"bg-charcoal w-full\" data-v-847178a5><section id=\"section-agent-mesh-problem\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-847178a5 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-847178a5><span class=\"size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-847178a5></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-847178a5>The problem</p></div><h2 class=\"text-chalk problem-list__headline mt-6 text-5xl font-normal leading-tight max-md:text-4xl max-md:leading-10\" data-v-847178a5><span class=\"block\" data-v-847178a5>A human &amp; agent team is vital to compete</span><span class=\"text-haze-500 block\" data-v-847178a5>but, we've seen where businesses get stuck</span></h2><ul class=\"mt-16 flex w-full flex-col\" data-v-847178a5><li class=\"problem-list__row--dark problem-list__row grid items-start gap-10 py-10\" data-v-847178a5><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\" data-v-847178a5><span class=\"font-fono text-lg text-spark\" data-v-847178a5>01</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-2xl font-normal leading-tight\" data-v-847178a5>Everyone builds their own</span></div><p class=\"text-haze-500 text-base leading-normal\" data-v-847178a5>Everyone gets a licence and training, but people build their own individual workflows. The duplication is expensive for the CFO and chaos for the COO.</p><span class=\"text-lg font-medium text-spark\" data-v-847178a5>Duplicated effort</span></li><li class=\"problem-list__row--dark problem-list__row grid items-start gap-10 py-10\" data-v-847178a5><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\" data-v-847178a5><span class=\"font-fono text-lg text-spark\" data-v-847178a5>02</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-2xl font-normal leading-tight\" data-v-847178a5>Knowledge is lost</span></div><p class=\"text-haze-500 text-base leading-normal\" data-v-847178a5>Shared wikis, hubs and skill libraries, nobody uses them or keeps them up to date, so AI still starts from a blank slate.</p><span class=\"text-lg font-medium text-spark\" data-v-847178a5>Low quality work</span></li><li class=\"problem-list__row--dark problem-list__row grid items-start gap-10 py-10\" data-v-847178a5><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\" data-v-847178a5><span class=\"font-fono text-lg text-spark\" data-v-847178a5>03</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-2xl font-normal leading-tight\" data-v-847178a5>Stuck in frontier models</span></div><p class=\"text-haze-500 text-base leading-normal\" data-v-847178a5>Lots of AI usage and agents means a huge AI bill. Most tokens are spent on frontier models doing basic routine work.</p><span class=\"text-lg font-medium text-spark\" data-v-847178a5>Expensive token bill</span></li><li class=\"problem-list__row--dark problem-list__row grid items-start gap-10 py-10\" data-v-847178a5><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\" data-v-847178a5><span class=\"font-fono text-lg text-spark\" data-v-847178a5>04</span><span class=\"text-chalk text-2xl font-normal leading-tight\" data-v-847178a5>Built to 75%</span></div><p class=\"text-haze-500 text-base leading-normal\" data-v-847178a5>Teams build their own systems to 75%, workflows are part-built, with no measurement, no owner improving them and no governance.</p><span class=\"text-lg font-medium text-spark\" data-v-847178a5>Stalled workflows</span></li></ul></section></div>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human",
