      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-chalk\" data-v-c097047b><section id=\"section-agent-mesh-layers\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-6\" style=\"\" data-v-c097047b data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-c097047b><span class=\"size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-c097047b></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-c097047b>The product</p></div><h2 class=\"layer-stack__headline mt-6 text-5xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor max-md:text-4xl max-md:leading-10\" data-v-c097047b><span class=\"layer-stack__headline-line block max-md:inline\" data-v-c097047b>That's why we built Agent Mesh:</span><span class=\"layer-stack__headline-line block text-haze-800 max-md:inline\" data-v-c097047b>a framework for connected agents, deployed by our AI experts, where you own your IP.</span></h2><div class=\"mt-16 flex w-full flex-col\" data-v-c097047b><article class=\"layer-stack__block grid items-start gap-14 py-16 max-md:gap-8 max-md:py-10\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4\" data-v-c097047b><span class=\"font-fono text-lg text-spark\" data-v-c097047b>01</span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-c097047b>System layer</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"flex max-w-prose flex-col gap-4\" data-v-c097047b><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Agents built for your business</h3><p class=\"text-lg leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>We design agents and workflows with shared company skills, tool integrations and permissioned sub-agents, so individual wins become company capability.</p></div><div class=\"layer-stack__points grid gap-x-16 gap-y-8\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Shared group and company workflows</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Company systems are in one admin layer and auto-deployed, so nobody has to search a shared hub.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Promote individual wins to company capability</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>The best skill one person built becomes the team standard rather than sitting in one person's chat history.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Continuous optimisation</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Skills improve based on evals, confidence scores and usage, and every personal agent gets the best version.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Where your team already works</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Personal agents live in Slack or your chat app of choice, so nobody has to learn a new tool.</p></div></div><div class=\"layer-stack__media w-full rounded-2xl p-4 max-md:p-2\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"content-image\" data-v-c097047b><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRpIAAABXRUJQVlA4WAoAAAAQAAAAHwAAFQAAQUxQSDwAAAABRwAUiD91K4eISENRZDtN4iBEAU1BU9AMYAULWM8/co3o/wR0JXO4iW1+KCCBCRT6Xkacsk1KBsLZCjxWUDggMAAAABADAJ0BKiAAFgA/OZC+V68ppyOoCqngJwlpAAA7fr0AAAD+7hspRjJIcxw8EBAAAA==);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-routines-admin.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-routines-admin.gen-1280w.avif 1280w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-routines-admin.gen.avif 1864w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 72rem\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-routines-admin.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-routines-admin.gen-1280w.webp 1280w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-routines-admin.gen.webp 1864w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 72rem\"><img src=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-routines-admin.gen.webp\" alt=\"The Agent Mesh routines admin, showing scheduled workflows assigned to groups\" class=\"layer-stack__screen block h-auto w-full content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div></div></article><article class=\"layer-stack__block grid items-start gap-14 py-16 max-md:gap-8 max-md:py-10\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4\" data-v-c097047b><span class=\"font-fono text-lg text-spark\" data-v-c097047b>02</span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-c097047b>Context layer</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"flex max-w-prose flex-col gap-4\" data-v-c097047b><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Unified company knowledge</h3><p class=\"text-lg leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Every agent starts from what your business already knows, with answers linked to verified sources. No more starting from scratch.</p></div><div class=\"layer-stack__points grid gap-x-16 gap-y-8\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Ground work in what the business knows</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Company knowledge lives in people's heads, disparate hubs and disconnected tools. Mesh captures decisions and client context, then uses them to power the work.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Verified sources for confidence</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Anyone can use a frontier model trained on the internet. Answers in Mesh are grounded in your business, with every claim linked to a memory or tool source.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>A wiki that builds itself</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Interactions build context across the company. We use this to auto-generate your company wiki and keep it up to date.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Integrate your tool stack</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Connect tools with native and MCP integrations. Bring your own stack, and each agent inherits its user's permissions.</p></div></div><div class=\"layer-stack__media w-full rounded-2xl p-4 max-md:p-2\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"content-image\" data-v-c097047b><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRp4AAABXRUJQVlA4WAoAAAAQAAAAHwAAEwAAQUxQSD0AAAABRwAUiD91K4eISENRbSvRxwRggymBxwRzACtYxeqwcx3R/wnIAnW4iXTcBIZABjC+nyziScelOl042xseAFZQOCA6AAAAEAMAnQEqIAAUAD85kr9Zvqmmo6gIA9AnCWkAz2QZycLAAP7tZx6BsDP0wKoai/JGLUyl3Lt1G4VAAA==);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-gathering-context.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-gathering-context.gen-1280w.avif 1280w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-gathering-context.gen.avif 1864w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 72rem\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-gathering-context.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-gathering-context.gen-1280w.webp 1280w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-gathering-context.gen.webp 1864w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 72rem\"><img src=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-gathering-context.gen.webp\" alt=\"Agent Mesh gathering context from Gmail and its own memory before answering a client question\" class=\"layer-stack__screen block h-auto w-full content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div></div></article><article class=\"layer-stack__block grid items-start gap-14 py-16 max-md:gap-8 max-md:py-10\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4\" data-v-c097047b><span class=\"font-fono text-lg text-spark\" data-v-c097047b>03</span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-c097047b>Quality layer</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"flex max-w-prose flex-col gap-4\" data-v-c097047b><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Outcomes you can rely on</h3><p class=\"text-lg leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>The pipework required to scale a system you can trust, meaning routing, guardrails, evals and measurement.</p></div><div class=\"layer-stack__points grid gap-x-16 gap-y-8\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Guardrails and human-in-the-loop</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Encode your policies. High-risk actions such as contract approvals trigger the right level of human review.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Evals and observability</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Confidence measured for every agent and skill. Know what is working, catch what is not.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex max-w-prose flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Stop paying frontier prices for routine work</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Mesh routes each request to the right model for the job, across providers and without losing context. Bring your own keys.</p></div><div class=\"layer-stack__routing rounded-2xl p-10 max-md:p-6\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"layer-routing grid items-stretch gap-16 max-md:gap-10\" data-v-c097047b data-v-f0fa13b6><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center\" data-v-f0fa13b6><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\" data-v-f0fa13b6><span class=\"text-5xl font-light text-spark\" data-v-f0fa13b6>Up to 80%</span><span class=\"text-base text-slatecolor\" data-v-f0fa13b6>modelled reduction in effective AI spend</span><span class=\"layer-routing__footnote mt-2 leading-normal text-haze-500\" data-v-f0fa13b6>58% conservative to 80% aggressive, modelled for typical enterprise API usage, August 2026 list prices</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center gap-6\" data-v-f0fa13b6><div class=\"flex items-stretch gap-0 max-md:flex-col max-md:gap-4\" data-v-f0fa13b6><div class=\"flex items-center\" data-v-f0fa13b6><div class=\"layer-routing__request rounded-xl border border-spark-50 bg-chalk px-6 py-5\" data-v-f0fa13b6><p class=\"text-xl font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-f0fa13b6>Agent</p><p class=\"text-base text-haze-800\" data-v-f0fa13b6>Shared context</p></div></div><svg class=\"layer-routing__connectors max-md:hidden\" viewbox=\"0 0 100 0\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-f0fa13b6></svg><ul class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3\" data-v-f0fa13b6><li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-haze bg-chalk px-5 py-3\" data-v-f0fa13b6><span class=\"bg-haze-500 layer-routing__dot shrink-0 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-f0fa13b6></span><span class=\"flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2.5\" data-v-f0fa13b6><span class=\"font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-f0fa13b6>Small model</span><span class=\"layer-routing__tier-meta text-haze-800\" data-v-f0fa13b6>routine extraction</span></span><span class=\"font-fono text-lg text-haze-800\" data-v-f0fa13b6>1x</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-haze bg-chalk px-5 py-3\" data-v-f0fa13b6><span class=\"bg-slatecolor layer-routing__dot shrink-0 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-f0fa13b6></span><span class=\"flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2.5\" data-v-f0fa13b6><span class=\"font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-f0fa13b6>Mid model</span><span class=\"layer-routing__tier-meta text-haze-800\" data-v-f0fa13b6>first-pass drafting</span></span><span class=\"font-fono text-lg text-haze-800\" data-v-f0fa13b6>4x</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-haze bg-chalk px-5 py-3\" data-v-f0fa13b6><span class=\"bg-spark layer-routing__dot shrink-0 rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-f0fa13b6></span><span class=\"flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2.5\" data-v-f0fa13b6><span class=\"font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-f0fa13b6>Frontier model</span><span class=\"layer-routing__tier-meta text-haze-800\" data-v-f0fa13b6>complex reasoning</span></span><span class=\"font-fono text-lg text-haze-800\" data-v-f0fa13b6>18x</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex max-w-prose flex-col gap-2\" data-v-c097047b><h4 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-c097047b>Measure what matters to drive adoption</h4><p class=\"text-base leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-c097047b>Weekly team-level reporting on adoption &amp; ROI, with insight on what to prioritise next.</p></div><div class=\"layer-stack__media w-full rounded-2xl p-4 max-md:p-2\" data-v-c097047b><div class=\"content-image\" data-v-c097047b><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRqIAAABXRUJQVlA4WAoAAAAQAAAAHwAAFAAAQUxQSEUAAAABVyAmTfqHHn5miIhsgFFsW23+d0BR0AyAg64EUoREQjTE6fvLbCP6PwHTEJzeyJhbRqAyk1DT79QSHRhTdRrMPbfFygcAVlA4IDYAAADwAgCdASogABUAPzmUwFm+qiaqqAgD0CcJaQAARhzLAAD+7WcQRU754ze80Pc9qwDPpkwAAAA=);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-weekly-team-report.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-weekly-team-report.gen-1280w.avif 1280w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-weekly-team-report.gen.avif 1866w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 72rem\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-weekly-team-report.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-weekly-team-report.gen-1280w.webp 1280w, /content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-weekly-team-report.gen.webp 1866w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 72rem\"><img src=\"/content-media/pages/agent-mesh/mesh-weekly-team-report.gen.webp\" alt=\"The Agent Mesh weekly team report, scoring activity, engagement, depth and ROI\" class=\"layer-stack__screen block h-auto w-full content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div></div></article></div></section></div>"
    },
