      "html": "<div class=\"bg-charcoal w-full\" data-v-072d457c><section id=\"section-agent-mesh-use-cases\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-072d457c data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-072d457c><span class=\"size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-072d457c></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-072d457c>Use cases</p></div><h2 class=\"text-chalk feature-grid__headline mt-6 text-5xl font-normal leading-tight max-md:text-4xl max-md:leading-10\" data-v-072d457c>Popular agents adding value</h2><ul class=\"feature-grid__items--three feature-grid__items mt-16 grid gap-5\" data-v-072d457c><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--dark\" data-v-072d457c><h3 class=\"text-chalk text-lg font-medium\">Pitch Engine</h3><p class=\"text-haze-500 text-base leading-normal\">Turns an RFP, brief or customer calls into a proposal draft in your voice, built from your credentials and case studies.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--dark\" data-v-072d457c><h3 class=\"text-chalk text-lg font-medium\">Client Intelligence</h3><p class=\"text-haze-500 text-base leading-normal\">Summarises client calls into insights and objections, then shares weekly themes with product, sales and marketing.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--dark\" data-v-072d457c><h3 class=\"text-chalk text-lg font-medium\">Cash Pack</h3><p class=\"text-haze-500 text-base leading-normal\">Runs a fortnightly cash flow forecast from CRM sales scenarios and the accounting system.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--dark\" data-v-072d457c><h3 class=\"text-chalk text-lg font-medium\">Account Growth</h3><p class=\"text-haze-500 text-base leading-normal\">Watches client buying signals and recommends upsell opportunities by stage.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--dark\" data-v-072d457c><h3 class=\"text-chalk text-lg font-medium\">Capacity Planner</h3><p class=\"text-haze-500 text-base leading-normal\">Reads backlogs and project plans, flags over and under allocation, then drafts the fortnight's resourcing plan.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--dark\" data-v-072d457c><h3 class=\"text-chalk text-lg font-medium\">Daily Briefing</h3><p class=\"text-haze-500 text-base leading-normal\">Reads 1:1 notes, calendar, emails and PM tools and makes a plan for the day.</p></li></ul></section></div>"
    },
