      "html": "<div class=\"bg-chalk w-full\" data-v-072d457c><section id=\"section-agent-mesh-included\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-072d457c data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-072d457c><span class=\"size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-072d457c></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-072d457c>What's included</p></div><h2 class=\"text-slatecolor feature-grid__headline mt-6 text-5xl font-normal leading-tight max-md:text-4xl max-md:leading-10\" data-v-072d457c>Included in every Agent Mesh deployment</h2><p class=\"text-haze-800 mt-4 max-w-prose text-lg leading-normal\" data-v-072d457c>One product, deployed by our AI engineers and configured around how your business already works.</p><ul class=\"feature-grid__items--four feature-grid__items mt-16 grid gap-5\" data-v-072d457c><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M12 4a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 0 7 3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7Z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M5 20a7 7 0 0 1 14 0\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">Personal Agents</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">A personal agent for every employee, adapted to their role and style.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M6 4v4\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M18 4v4\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M6 8h12\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M12 8v4\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M4 12h4v4H4z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M10 12h4v4h-4z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M16 12h4v4h-4z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">LLM Router</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">Right model for the job, across providers. Bring your own keys.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M4 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5v18H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M20 5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-5v18h5a2 2 0 0 0 2-2z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">Knowledge Core</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">Self-building wiki for answers grounded in the business, linked to sources.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M9 3v5\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M15 3v5\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M6 8h12v3a6 6 0 0 1-12 0z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M12 17v4\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">Tools &amp; Integrations</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">Native and MCP, including the platforms you built yourselves.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M12 3l7 3v6c0 4-3 7-7 9-4-2-7-5-7-9V6z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">Guardrails</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">Policies encoded, human-in-the-loop for high-risk actions.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M15 3a5 5 0 0 0-4.6 7L4 16.4V20h3.6l6.4-6.4A5 5 0 0 0 21 9l-3 3-3-3 3-3a5 5 0 0 0-3-3Z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">Agent Toolkit</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">In-house teams extend the system with their own agents.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M12 4.5a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-2 5.2A3 3 0 0 0 9 18a3 3 0 0 0 3 1.5A3 3 0 0 0 15 18a3 3 0 0 0 2-5.3 3 3 0 0 0-2-5.2 3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M12 4.5v15\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">Memory</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">Knowledge graph for personal memory to embed longer-term context.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M12 3l8 4-8 4-8-4z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M4 12l8 4 8-4\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M4 17l8 4 8-4\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">Global Skills &amp; Routines</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">Promote the best to a team or the company. Every agent gets the latest.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M12 3a9 9 0 1 0 0 18 2 2 0 0 0 1.6-3.2 2 2 0 0 1 1.6-3.2H18a3 3 0 0 0 3-3A9 9 0 0 0 12 3Z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M8 10h.01\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M16 11h.01\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">System &amp; Brand</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">White-label environment with brand voice and system guidelines baked in.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M4 5h16v10H9l-5 4z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">Chat Integrations</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">Slack and the chat apps your team already uses.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M15 4a5 5 0 1 1-4.6 7L4 17.4V21h3.6l1-1v-2h2v-2h2l1.4-1.4A5 5 0 0 0 15 4Z\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">Permissions</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">Scoped access and RBAC that mirrors the org structure.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl p-8 feature-grid__card--light\" data-v-072d457c><svg class=\"feature-grid-icon mb-2 text-spark\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-b7ff5377><path d=\"M4 17a8 8 0 1 1 16 0\" data-v-b7ff5377></path><path d=\"M12 17l4-5\" data-v-b7ff5377></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-medium\">Evals &amp; Observability</h3><p class=\"text-haze-800 text-base leading-normal\">Confidence for every agent and skill, improved from real usage.</p></li></ul></section></div>"
