      "html": "<div class=\"bg-charcoal relative w-full overflow-clip py-32\" data-v-7d0248b3><section id=\"section-agent-mesh-how-it-works\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full pointer-events-auto relative z-10\" style=\"\" data-v-7d0248b3 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"w-full\" data-v-7d0248b3><div class=\"@container flex w-full flex-col max-md:gap-12 gap-20\" data-v-7d0248b3 data-v-208a8e74><div class=\"service-pillar-panel__intro--full service-pillar-panel__intro\" data-v-208a8e74><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10\" data-v-208a8e74><h2 class=\"flex w-full flex-col\" data-v-208a8e74><span class=\"text-spark max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">How it works</span><span class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-chalk\">Get the benefits of building in-house, without the burden</span></h2></div></div><div class=\"service-pillar-panel__offerings\" data-v-208a8e74><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-10 bg-haze-900\" data-v-208a8e74><h3 class=\"text-2xl pb-2.5 font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">01</span><span class=\"text-chalk block font-medium\">We deploy Agent Mesh</span></h3><p class=\"text-haze-300 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Get access to personal agents and the pipework: routing, memory, permissions and evals, working from day one and kept up to date so you don't have to.</p></article><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-10 bg-haze-900\" data-v-208a8e74><h3 class=\"text-2xl pb-2.5 font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">02</span><span class=\"text-chalk block font-medium\">We build agents and drive adoption</span></h3><p class=\"text-haze-300 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Our AI engineers and strategists embed with your team to co-design workflows and guardrails for how your business operates, and champion adoption inside it.</p></article><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-10 bg-haze-900\" data-v-208a8e74><h3 class=\"text-2xl pb-2.5 font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\"><span class=\"block text-spark\">03</span><span class=\"text-chalk block font-medium\">You own the IP on the system</span></h3><p class=\"text-haze-300 text-lg leading-normal tracking-tight\">Everything built is portable across model providers, extendable by your own team, and yours to keep or sell. Transition capability in-house over time.</p></article></div></div></div></section></div>"
